  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Yep. Every pixel, every line of code,  \r\nevery creepy AI, every squeaky
    door,  \r\nand every spooky sound effect.\r\n\r\nNo team. No extras. Just me.
    Alone.  \r\nLiterally everything. Every single thing.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSound
    Effects:  \r\n- Sourced from Pixabay Audio Library  \r\n- Big thanks to the amazing
    creators who generously share their work!  \r\n\r\n(Should I mention individual
    names? Maybe next time. For now: THANK YOU!)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBuilding Assets: 
    \r\n- Mostly from the Unity Asset Store  \r\n- Because even a lone wolf needs
    some sharp tools.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSpecial Thanks to Our Legendary Game Tester: 
    \r\nArgus66  \r\nDelta Force Secret Agent  \r\n(He tested the game, survived,
    and still hasn't sent a rescue team.)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIgnore the bugs. They're
    \u201Cfeatures\u201D in disguise.  \r\nThis game is perfect exactly the way it
    is. Trust me.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThank you for playing \"Misogannist\"!  \r\nHope
    you enjoyed the horror, the chaos,  \r\nand the occasional *\u201CWhat just happened?!\u201D*\r\n\r\nCreated
    with passion,  \r\na touch of madness,  \r\nand a whole lot of caffeine.\r\n\r\nIGNITE"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d3df790eef1fe54eb136c55b3b7f38e, type: 2}
